        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-oster-mechanochemical-chondrogenesis-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-oster-mechanochemical-chondrogenesis-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Oster, Murray & Harris (1983) / Oster, Murray & Maini (1985) mechanochemical limb chondrogenesis — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 5 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L440-515): critical traction threshold tau_c = 1.2776 (subcritical control = 0 condensations), simulated 4-digit autopod wavelength vs analytical lambda_c = 6.5469 (CV = 0.0000), 5-zone limb branching mode progression [0, 1, 2, 4, 5] RMSE = 0.0000 (Pearson r = 1.0000), salamander forelimb autopod spacing 39.00 px (hierarchy [1, 2, 4], r = 0.8744), and salamander hindlimb autopod spacing 41.50 px (hierarchy [1, 2, 5])." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
